1
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:29,039
Who are you?

2
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:31,000
I am Yuwen Jingxuan.

3
00:01:33,479 --> 00:01:34,320
Then...

4
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:38,200
Then who am I?

5
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:01,040
Yuwen Jingxuan.

6
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:01,840
Are you crazy?

7
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:03,320
Without the Soul Jade, you will become a delirious

8
00:02:03,320 --> 00:02:04,520
and chaotic madman.

9
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:05,160
How could you make such a big decision

10
00:02:05,160 --> 00:02:06,960
without discussing it with me?

11
00:02:07,240 --> 00:02:08,900
I'm perfectly fine, aren't I?

12
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:13,220
Then what are you going to do next?

13
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:14,520
We will cross that bridge

14
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,520
when we come to it.

15
00:02:15,880 --> 00:02:19,200
I'm asking what you plan to do about Miss Tang.

16
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:23,780
She lost her memory again.

17
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,480
But that's fine.

18
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:29,040
We can start over again.

19
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:36,000
Can't we?

20
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:55,260
Your Highness, have some snacks.

21
00:03:12,040 --> 00:03:13,880
Aren't you afraid I poisoned it?

22
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:17,540
It's not like you haven't done it before.

23
00:03:19,600 --> 00:03:21,060
No matter what you give me,

24
00:03:21,720 --> 00:03:23,160
I'll eat it anyway.

25
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:27,360
Your Highness, the palace has sent rewards

26
00:03:27,720 --> 00:03:29,120
to celebrate your birthday.

27
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:30,650
Please receive the decree.

28
00:03:35,760 --> 00:03:37,120
Today is your birthday.

29
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:40,160
But why is no one celebrating in the mansion?

30
00:03:42,200 --> 00:03:43,930
I never celebrate my birthday.

31
00:03:45,320 --> 00:03:46,380
I'll be right back.

32
00:04:00,760 --> 00:04:02,120
Today is his birthday.

33
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:05,860
I should think about what to make for him.

34
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:15,760
You're back.

35
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:18,920
Today is your birthday.

36
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:21,120
I made these longevity noodles for you.

37
00:04:23,320 --> 00:04:25,080
Yunling taught me how to make them.

38
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:26,280
If they don't taste good,

39
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:27,360
please don't mind.

40
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:35,840
You really made these for me?

41
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:42,210
No one has ever made longevity noodles for me before.

42
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:46,000
Thank you.

43
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:48,770
Quick, try them.

44
00:04:59,200 --> 00:05:00,330
They're delicious.

45
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:15,400
Ah, what's wrong?

46
00:05:17,080 --> 00:05:18,010
Yuwen Jingxuan!

47
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,320
As expected, without the Soul Jade,

48
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:26,240
it just won't work.

49
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:28,320
What is a Soul Jade?

50
00:05:29,440 --> 00:05:30,760
Jingxuan has a Soul Jade.

51
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:32,220
He wears it all year round.

52
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:33,200
It can stabilize his mind

53
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:34,320
and relieve his headaches.

54
00:05:34,320 --> 00:05:35,920
But now the Soul Jade is lost.

55
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:40,000
Is it the jade he mentioned to me before,

56
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:42,200
the one that looks like my birthmark?

57
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:47,440
Did he do it to save me?

58
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:53,760
No wonder he is always moody

59
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,730
and unpredictable.

60
00:06:43,440 --> 00:06:44,240
Zhiye.

61
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:46,960
Jingxuan, you're awake.

62
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:51,840
Fortunately, the prescription Miss Tang left

63
00:06:51,840 --> 00:06:53,840
has temporarily controlled your condition.

64
00:06:53,840 --> 00:06:54,900
Where is Miss Tang?

65
00:06:56,440 --> 00:06:58,120
Your longevity noodles got cold,

66
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,920
so she went to make you a new bowl.

67
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:05,960
You've finally seen the light at the end of the tunnel.

68
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:11,120
Your Highness, Young Master Su!

69
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:12,360
Something terrible has happened!

70
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:14,680
Miss Tang trespassed into the Shang Manor

71
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:16,200
and has been captured.

72
00:07:16,760 --> 00:07:20,120
Prince Yu sent a message saying that only if you go personally...

73
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:21,780
Only then can we release them.

74
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:24,480
Jingxuan.

75
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:49,560
Sixth Brother, you besieged the royal uncle's private residence today.

76
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:52,280
Are you going to force the Emperor to abdicate tomorrow?

77
00:07:52,280 --> 00:07:54,680
Prince Shuo, if you stop now,

78
00:07:55,200 --> 00:07:58,440
I can still keep my mouth shut in front of His Majesty.

79
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:02,080
Otherwise...

80
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:05,740
Lady Shang is merely a step-empress.

81
00:08:05,840 --> 00:08:08,160
His Majesty has never issued a clear edict.

82
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:11,220
Lord Shang's title of royal uncle is self-proclaimed.

83
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,960
Since Lord Shang wants to report to the throne,

84
00:08:13,960 --> 00:08:15,520
why don't we go together?

85
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:17,840
You can impeach me for attacking your private residence,

86
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:21,200
and I will impeach you for great disrespect.

87
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:25,000
Young Master Su is unmatched in eloquence.

88
00:08:25,400 --> 00:08:27,480
Uncle, you'd better not argue with him.

89
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:28,480
Enough nonsense.

90
00:08:29,280 --> 00:08:30,280
Lord Shuo is here.

91
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:31,600
Hand over Miss Tang.

92
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:35,520
Oh, Young Master Su, what are you talking about?

93
00:08:36,559 --> 00:08:38,440
Miss Tang is a grown woman.

94
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,880
She can go wherever she wants.

95
00:08:41,679 --> 00:08:43,520
How could I control her?

96
00:08:44,880 --> 00:08:46,040
Besides,

97
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:50,320
I promised Miss Tang I would grant her every request.

98
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:52,560
A gentleman's word

99
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:54,730
is worth its weight in gold.

100
00:08:56,040 --> 00:08:58,240
Miss Tang has sought refuge with me now.

101
00:08:58,440 --> 00:09:00,960
She can stay as long as she likes.

102
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:08,200
No one can take her away from me.

103
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:43,280
Yuwen Jingxuan is in danger.

104
00:09:43,280 --> 00:09:44,560
Only you can save him.

105
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:47,040
Why should I believe you?

106
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:49,440
Who knows if you are deceiving me?

107
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:07,090
So everything he said was true.

108
00:10:10,280 --> 00:10:13,080
Tang Zhiluo, only if you keep dying for him,

109
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:15,640
will the imperial destiny return to its place,

110
00:10:15,640 --> 00:10:18,080
and Yuwen Jingxuan become a wise ruler.

111
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:20,360
This is what you must accomplish.

112
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:06,040
Zhiluo!

113
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:07,100
Go quickly!

114
00:11:12,640 --> 00:11:13,440
Zhiluo!

115
00:11:19,800 --> 00:11:20,600
I'm sorry.

116
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:26,920
I shouldn't have doubted you.

117
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:32,320
Don't be sad,

118
00:11:33,240 --> 00:11:34,560
and don't feel guilty.

119
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:37,880
I'm not just doing this for you,

120
00:11:38,880 --> 00:11:42,240
but also for the people of the world.

121
00:11:42,560 --> 00:11:44,840
I don't want you to go!

122
00:11:57,760 --> 00:11:58,560
Zhiluo!
